    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can explain concepts in different ways. They can adapt to different learning styles. They can help students practice problems and get instant feedback. They could also offer personalized tutoring. This makes learning more accessible and less intimidating. It’s a good tool for supplementing traditional teaching."
